																						"en_US": "<ul>\n\t<li>Create a personal area</li>\n\t<li>Manage collaborative spaces with other colleagues independently</li>\n\t<li>Access the various company workspaces, projects, products and much more</li>\n\t<li>Create and modify documents via browser even in co-editing mode</li>\n\t<li>Read and publish communications on specific digital bulletin boards</li>\n\t<li>Use calendars, forums, wikis and much more by seizing the opportunity to work remotely to optimize productivity</li>\n\t<li>Deliverable on Saas and on Premises.</li>\n</ul>"
